                <button onclick="askDoctor()" class="bg-surface-container-lowest hover:bg-surface-container-high text-primary font-label-md text-xs sm:text-sm px-4 py-2.5 rounded-xl shrink-0 transition-colors shadow-sm cursor-pointer font-bold border border-primary/20 self-start sm:self-auto">
                    Đặt câu hỏi cho Bác sĩ
